WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.077 --> 00:00:08.368
The shark swam closer.

2
00:00:08.369 --> 00:00:11.274
Mo took a deep breath.

3
00:00:11.275 --> 00:00:16.717
Then he grew big and spiky!

4
00:00:16.718 --> 00:00:19.921
"You won't eat me, shark!" he cried.

5
00:00:19.922 --> 00:00:24.620
"I'm big and spiky."

6
00:00:24.621 --> 00:00:28.923
"Oh!" The shark blinked.

7
00:00:28.924 --> 00:00:33.568
"And you will help me!" Mo said.

8
00:00:33.569 --> 00:00:42.509
The shark sighed. "Fine. You're too spiky to eat."

9
00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:47.664
"Phew!" Mo thought.

10
00:00:47.665 --> 00:00:51.535
Mo led the shark to the trap.

11
00:00:51.536 --> 00:00:56.512
"It's a shark!" the lobsters cried.

12
00:00:56.513 --> 00:00:59.666
"Don't worry!" Mo said.

13
00:00:59.667 --> 00:01:02.664
"He's here to help us."

14
00:01:02.665 --> 00:01:08.953
Cora looked nervous.

15
00:01:08.954 --> 00:01:14.330
Chomp! The shark bit down on the cage.

16
00:01:14.331 --> 00:01:21.196
The bars snapped, and the cage came apart.

17
00:01:21.197 --> 00:01:30.274
"We're free!" the lobsters cried.

18
00:01:30.275 --> 00:01:35.485
Cora got her arm out of the nets.

19
00:01:35.486 --> 00:01:38.672
"Thank you, Mo!" she said.

20
00:01:38.673 --> 00:01:42.493
"You were so brave!"

21
00:01:42.494 --> 00:01:47.760
"What about me?" the shark said.

22
00:01:47.761 --> 00:01:51.348
"Thank you for helping us," Mo said.

23
00:01:51.349 --> 00:01:57.844
The shark smiled. "I'm still hungry."

24
00:01:57.845 --> 00:02:02.689
"Um, we have some plants," Cora said.

25
00:02:02.690 --> 00:02:06.687
"No, thanks," the shark said.

26
00:02:06.688 --> 00:02:13.723
The shark looked at Mo. "I want to eat . . ."

27
00:02:13.724 --> 00:02:16.794
Mo grew big and spiky.

28
00:02:16.795 --> 00:02:20.422
The hammerhead frowned and swam away.

29
00:02:20.423 --> 00:02:33.836
Then Mo flipped upside down. "Oops!"

